[0.004299, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36mclausecraft — 2-minute Phase 6 demo\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mCounterfactual known-bad NDA → deviation table → redline .docx\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mRecorded against http://localhost:18000; contract: demo/known-bad-nda.pdf\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m[1/7] (a) stack status\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m$ docker compose ps\u001b[0m\r\n"]
