[42.119287, "o", "\u001b[1m[3/7] (c) Upload → (d) select PDF → (e) Triage\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m$ curl -sS -X POST http://localhost:18000/contracts/ingest \\\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m       -F file=@demo/known-bad-nda.pdf -F language=en\u001b[0m\r\n"]
