[118.517523, "o", "\u001b[1m[7/7] (k) close — what you just saw\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[1mingest\u001b[0m  →  \u001b[1mspot\u001b[0m  →  \u001b[1m5 deviations\u001b[0m  →  \u001b[1mapprove 2\u001b[0m  →  \u001b[1mredline.docx\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mLive API:    http://localhost:18000\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mReference:   demo/expected-redline.docx (5 w:ins / 5 w:del, author=clausecraft)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mRe-run:      asciinema play demo/asciinema.cast\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mRe-record:   asciinema rec -c 'bash demo/asciinema.sh' demo/asciinema.cast\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
